        "sha": "e194c4ea70edb818b24b969b6da82d5694e7e715",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/e194c4ea70edb818b24b969b6da82d5694e7e715"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree e194c4ea70edb818b24b969b6da82d5694e7e715\nparent 4c045f1a0323af6621100a7e6479f04205d50c7a\nauthor Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1786533124 +0100\ncommitter Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1786533124 +0100\n\ncmake: De-duplicate libraries where possible\n\nSet the CMP0156 and CMP0179 policies to NEW. CMP0156 de-duplicates\nlibraries on link lines based on linker capabilities; CMP0179 makes\nthis de-duplication keep the first occurrence of static libraries.\nThis silences Apple linker \"ignoring duplicate libraries\" warnings.\n\nBoth policies are gated on CMP0179, which requires CMake >=3.31, to\navoid the intermediate CMake 3.29/3.30 behaviour where only CMP0156\nis available. This requirement is satisfied by the current Homebrew\npackage and the Guix build environment. On older versions the policy\nguard makes this a no-op.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE0dvyxLlvLev0wWZUQQEIES5+qB8FAmp8VQQACgkQQQEIES5+\nqB/KPw//RFf9B5RddiQMtufEXeMcZ4q0QL9vV2AvKEiLg1bG8ogpnGer+FdNXMYq\nu4ApVGKMmgjJdDkFioJGmX4XfpT+ZLHOPIWSuS/45g72kDXWC6Qke+jWEpoEy6cp\nqxtLSZuMiDHlHeBYa8ydEJRewx7dbRELy4utpH19qlBvZwnMoiNbOLMj99MkHOY2\nANM7xUsNm7Lf0XEzCc71ij9Tgybzsra86Qg6ztzELWRFy6eXutev52erdUt28RKe\ntgCFSFI/SK1zx25QE5y7HigTxFJj+ZxMq2/1MpngrFRMEAq1Fvral2uk3LDkUTfd\nIf2sdo0x8Z44lPuIcreeTOzbIH37OOPPzInIu7f1cSOVI/Hlemp8xtcADNmeExrW\nJDneXv5Gg6bB6wxIu7Rz1qKPQKJMusHu7hiCntKSy90dqx9HrLZpwbTxqw0BiczS\nIzW8DNbFVTUCcUQVKPSh9ZNrkHiKT2LB+L6qoneFASv0CPsK+N7HLHg9joD43jKh\n0uqcpLSTNz0uhYUsBQpv5EG4bHkDaRy0aqagl8pL+glg0PXoRd9RcAMnOsLwQlLw\nbBhgp8SzVhHFLBsJDPlyWsD5LAjEad2XLIxuRO8F6P7ONqi+0RYhnCCqTBpdoPrd\n7rgqPFvsJNzoJsgFGexLY0FdMaZV9IoS1O63r0IRvFJs4IBqjAg=\n=vjji\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
